      "title": "Settlement review: unverified email and eligibility exclusions",
      "body": "Peak email's claimsfast link is unverified: no official program page links to it. Email dated Oct 10 demanded action in 48 hours, already elapsed; do not file there or share bank numbers. Use official Peak claimhub link only. Harborline settlement covers 2019\u20132022; all six available payments are Sep 2025\u2013Feb 2026, so no supported eligibility. ValuePlus settlement requires scam losses through money transfers; five 2022 generic store charges do not prove transfers or scam losses, so do not file based on merchant match alone. No sign of unwanted subscriptions in supplied notes.",
      "status": "done",
      "result_status": null,
      "fields": {}
